  "id": "mexican-chicken-and-rice-bake",
  "name": "Mexican Chicken and Rice Bake",
  "subtitle": "A hearty one-dish bake with chicken, beans, peppers, corn, and cheese.",
  "description": "Combine cooked rice with seasoned chicken, vegetables, beans, and tomatoes, then bake until the chicken is fully cooked and finish with melted cheese.",
